    "detailed_description": "SUSHI Race is a simple and fun game that anyone can enjoy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach sushi machine has its own appeal!<br />\r\nBattle and win with your favorites!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDrift around curves with flair!<br />\r\nUtilize items like soy-sauce missiles and blockers to outspeed your rivals!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Time Attack\u3011<br />\r\nChoose a course and record your best time!<br />\r\nCompete with players from around the world in online rankings!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Free Race\u3011<br />\r\nChoose a course to challenge with friends and CPUs!<br />\r\nExcitement will climb as items appear throughout the course!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Grand Prix\u3011<br />\r\nRun through several courses of your choice in order!<br />\r\nAccumulate wins and become the grand champion!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy playing with up to 4 players!<br />\r\nChallenge friends and family for 1st place and have fun!",
